      "content": "it's just hard to care about \"help\" when everything feels so hollow. people keep telling me to find an anchor, to find something to hold onto, but what if there's nothing there? what if the emptiness is the only real thing? it feels less like a struggle and more like i'm just... waiting to dissolve.",
